*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!crates/**
!apps/
!apps/sysknife-cli/
!apps/sysknife-cli/**
!apps/sysknife-shell/
!apps/sysknife-shell/src-tauri/
!apps/sysknife-shell/src-tauri/**
# The ClusterFuzzLite image (.clusterfuzzlite/Dockerfile) is built from this same
# context and copies the whole of it, so the fuzz crate and its build script have
# to be let through. The root Dockerfile copies named paths only, so nothing here
# reaches the Glama image. Fuzzer build output stays out.
!fuzz/
!fuzz/**
fuzz/target
fuzz/artifacts
fuzz/coverage
!.clusterfuzzlite/
!.clusterfuzzlite/**
